        "original_id": "61979ca3-8fe0-5439-bd9f-0d4fb3d12df9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Taprobane Island\n- People: Paul Bowles, Sir Desmond Lorenz de Silva, Geoffrey Dobbs\n- Roles: American author and composer, former UN Chief Prosecutor, Australian businessman\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Frederic Bowles was an American expatriate composer, author, and translator who lived from December 30, 1910 to November 18, 1999.\n- Taprobane Island passed to the American author and composer Paul Bowles.\n- Taprobane Island later passed to the Sri Lankan-born former UN Chief Prosecutor Sir Desmond Lorenz de Silva.\n- Taprobane Island later came into the ownership of the Australian businessman Geoffrey Dobbs.",
